{"text": "Proactive measures for motivating teams include promotions and salary increases contingent upon teamwork success. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In addition, it is important to continue to sweeten the pot, so to speak. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All new hires would be evaluated on a set of personality characteristics held in as high regard as education, experience, and technical competence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If teams are going to be the measure of success in the organization, the existing paradigm of the individual has to be eliminated. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I worked in one company that had a number of prima donnas in key areas. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I could never understand why these people were kept on the payroll. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> No matter what technical skills these people had, they were frequently mentioned as barriers that, instead of being removed, were worked around. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People complained about the friction occurring in meetings with these people where business issues were supposed to be resolved. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Instead, what little teamwork might have evolved was never given a chance. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A team centered culture cannot even begin to take shape with individuals such as these.", "alignment": {"characters": ["P", "r", "o", "a", "c", "t", "i", "v", "e", " ", "m", "e", "a", "s", "u", "r", "e", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "m", "o", "t", "i", "v", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "e", "a", "m", "s", " ", "i", "n", "c", "l", "u", "d", "e", " ", "p", "r", "o", "m", "o", "t", "i", "o", "n", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "l", "a", "r", "y", " ", "i", "n", "c", "r", "e", "a", "s", "e", "s", " ", "c", "o", "n", "t", "i", "n", "g", "e", "n", "t", " ", "u", "p", "o", "n", " ", "t", "e", "a", "m", "w", "o", "r", "k", " ", "s", "u", "c", "c", "e", "s", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "a